{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16307130","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16307130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1630713001:0":{"text":"들었어? 레이먼 교장 선생님께서 돌아가셨대...","source_cn":"听说了吗，雷蒙校长去世了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31454631A9D26F02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1630713002:0":{"text":"너무 안타까워. 교장 선생님은 정말 좋은 분이셨데 말이야.","source_cn":"好可惜啊，校长人特别好","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B7274C8683BDFD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1630713003:0":{"text":"수업 중에 몰래 소설을 보다가 교장 선생님한테 들켰었는데, 아무 말도 안 하셨어.","source_cn":"有一次我上课时偷偷看小说，他发现了，但没有批评我","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B1D979B7C9642E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1630713004:0":{"text":"새로운 교장 선생님도 좋은 분이면 좋겠다...","source_cn":"希望新校长和他一样好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C810BD1B7C6717D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:女预科生A":{"text":"女预科生A","source":"女预科生A","status":"source"},"speaker:男预科生A":{"text":"男预科生A","source":"男预科生A","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}